title: "Repo Audit: Claude Code skill that checks an untrusted repo for backdoors before you run it"
abstract: "Audit an untrusted repo before you run it: fake interview take-homes, recruiter-sent projects, zips. Reads, never executes. Maps autorun points, triages dependencies, hunts remote-code loaders, obfuscation, hidden Unicode and blockchain payloads, checks git history and your machine, returns CLEAN / SUSPICIOUS / MALICIOUS with file:line evidence."
